      "snippet": {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "expBumpMomentMatrix a β : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) ℝ := fun i j => ∫ t, Real.exp (a i * t) * β j t — the general n×n un-normalized moment matrix whose 2×2 translated-bump instance is the paper's pre-division B"
